  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "7150012",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "715001201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "715001201": {
            "id": "715001201",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Cloud Retainer",
            "text": "Good, good. These are the Bamboo Shoots that Ganyu prepared for oneself.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "715001202"
            ]
          },
          "715001202": {
            "id": "715001202",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Cloud Retainer",
            "text": "The ingredients have all been prepared. Let us make ready to cook."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7150001",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Cloud Retainer",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "715000101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "715000101": {
            "id": "715000101",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Cloud Retainer",
            "text": "Mm... Perhaps this path is best...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "715000102"
            ]
          },
          "715000102": {
            "id": "715000102",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Cloud Retainer",
            "text": "Ah, Traveler. Fine timing. Only recently has one finished setting this device up.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "715000104",
              "715000106"
            ]
          },
          "715000104": {
            "id": "715000104",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Cloud Retainer",
            "text": "Verily. Much personal work has one put into it, and its faculties are vast.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "715000107"
            ]
          },
          "715000107": {
            "id": "715000107",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Cloud Retainer",
            "text": "Much lore did one read in the construction of this cuisine-making machine. Know that there are a few key points in the art of \"making food.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "715000108"
            ]
          },
          "715000108": {
            "id": "715000108",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Cloud Retainer",
            "text": "The first of these is finding ingredients, which are of utmost importance in cooking. Many long years have countless chefs labored and wandered in search of all manner of ingredients...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "715000109"
            ]
          },
          "715000109": {
            "id": "715000109",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Cloud Retainer",
            "text": "One's device aims to solve this issue first of all.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "715000110"
            ]
          },
          "715000110": {
            "id": "715000110",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Cloud Retainer",
            "text": "Upon activation, it will automatically search for suitable ingredients nearby, and will mark their scent out, all the better for chefs to track them to their source.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "715000111"
            ]
          },
          "715000111": {
            "id": "715000111",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Can't it go grab those ingredients by itself?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "715000112"
            ]
          },
          "715000112": {
            "id": "715000112",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Cloud Retainer",
            "text": "Ahem. This... Early days yet would one call this stage of work, and this issue of how a stove may trek across treacherous mountain roads by itself has yet to be resolved.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "715000113"
            ]
          },
          "715000113": {
            "id": "715000113",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Cloud Retainer",
            "text": "Now then, the second matter is the cooking itself. One has placed countless intricate components in this device's interior, such that the mere act of placing ingredients within will see them automatically processed.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "715000114"
            ]
          },
          "715000114": {
            "id": "715000114",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "How does it know how to do that?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "715000115"
            ]
          },
          "715000115": {
            "id": "715000115",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Cloud Retainer",
            "text": "Well... Naturally, it references the corresponding recipe in determining how the ingredients are to be processed.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "715000116"
            ]
          },
          "715000116": {
            "id": "715000116",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Cloud Retainer",
            "text": "Its inner workings are difficult to explain in a short time. You only need to know that resolving this matter took quite some work.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "715000117"
            ]
          },
          "715000117": {
            "id": "715000117",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Cloud Retainer",
            "text": "Much thought has one also bent to an affair most troubling for chefs — the cleaning of one's cooking utensils.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "715000118"
            ]
          },
          "715000118": {
            "id": "715000118",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Cloud Retainer",
            "text": "Quite a spoilage of a lovely scene of feasting it would be to have to clean up leftovers in the pot otherwise, no?"
          },
          "715000106": {
            "id": "715000106",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Cloud Retainer",
            "text": "Hmph, how hasty of you. Be at ease, and let one explain it to you."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7150002",
      "subQuestName": "Follow the aura trail and find the ingredients",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "715000201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "715000201": {
            "id": "715000201",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Cloud Retainer",
            "text": "Have the Bamboo Shoots been reclaimed?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7150003",
      "subQuestName": "Get the ingredients",
      "sceneId": null,
