      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7150008",
      "subQuestName": "Report back to Cloud Retainer",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "715000801"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "715000801": {
            "id": "715000801",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Cloud Retainer",
            "text": "The flames shall be yours to command, Traveler."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7150011",
      "subQuestName": "Report back to Cloud Retainer",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "715001301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "715001301": {
            "id": "715001301",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Cloud Retainer",
            "text": "Very good! Verily do the capabilities of this machine exceed the norm!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "715001302"
            ]
          },
          "715001302": {
            "id": "715001302",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Cloud Retainer",
            "text": "The fine control exercised in processing this Tofu... Indeed, one has outdone oneself.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "715001303"
            ]
          },
          "715001303": {
            "id": "715001303",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Cloud Retainer",
            "text": "This is thanks to your aid as well, Traveler. Allow one to bestow a copy of the Oncidium Tofu recipe upon you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "715001304"
            ]
          },
          "715001304": {
            "id": "715001304",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Cloud Retainer",
            "text": "You may attempt to make it again, should time allow.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "715001305"
            ]
          },
          "715001305": {
            "id": "715001305",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Cloud Retainer",
            "text": "Further adjustments must one make to this machine's faculties...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "715001306"
            ]
          },
          "715001306": {
            "id": "715001306",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Cloud Retainer",
            "text": "One might still need your help. One trusts that you will not decline, yes?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7150003",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "715000303"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "715000303": {
            "id": "715000303",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Cloud Retainer",
            "text": "Then the rest can be left to this machine. However, Traveler, the heat control is yours to tend to.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "715000304"
            ]
          },
          "715000304": {
            "id": "715000304",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Can't this machine do that by itself?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "715000305"
            ]
          },
          "715000305": {
            "id": "715000305",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Cloud Retainer",
            "text": "Well... One has tried several times to use an internal flame in an attempt to achieve autonomous heat control...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "715000306"
            ]
          },
          "715000306": {
            "id": "715000306",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Cloud Retainer",
            "text": "But the flame on the Supreme Cuisine Machine's stove is far from ordinary. One must use one's own adeptal flame to operate it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "715000307"
            ]
          },
          "715000307": {
            "id": "715000307",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Cloud Retainer",
            "text": "Adeptal flames of such power would warp the shape of the internal components if fed directly into the machine's interior. Sacrificing the larger machine for some small gain is thus unwise.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "715000308"
            ]
          },
          "715000308": {
            "id": "715000308",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Cloud Retainer",
            "text": "The best solution at present is to apply the adeptal flames externally. As such, one requires a helper to control the heat of said flames...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "715000309"
            ]
          },
          "715000309": {
            "id": "715000309",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Cloud Retainer",
            "text": "The all-important flames shall be yours to command, Traveler. When you are ready, inform one at once."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7150007",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "715000701"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "715000701": {
            "id": "715000701",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Cloud Retainer",
            "text": "How is it? Is the Oncidium Tofu complete?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7150010",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "715001001"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "715001001": {
            "id": "715001001",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I'm not ready yet.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "715001002"
            ]
          },
          "715001002": {
            "id": "715001002",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Cloud Retainer",
            "text": "Hmm. Ready yourself, then, and inform one once it is so."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}